            "review_title": "Review at Truong Chi - Bun Cha",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nCool Local Experience and Good Food!\nApr 2019 • Solo\nWhile out exploring the local area around the Ho Chi Minh Trail Museum, stopped for lunch at this place. Honestly, I didn't really have much rhyme or reason for choosing this spot. I ate out on the sidewalk next to a bunch of employees of a local bank. It was nice to be in a place where I was likely the only foreign visitor they'd ever had. People were very curious as to whether I'd like the food. Honestly, I did. But I'd had Bun Cha before. I wanted to submit this review because there were NO reviews of restaurants in this area of Hanoi.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 21, 2019",
